---
description: Write feedback for bugs or change requests for the backend developer
---
<!-- fbc-version: 1 -->

Check `.claude/related-projects.md` for the path to the backend repo.
If the file or the path is missing, ask the user for it and store it there for next time (the file is gitignored, so it holds machine-local paths).

Then in the backend repo directory in the folder `feedback/` write a new md file with `yyyy_mm_dd_TITLE.md` format of what changes you need.

NOTE: This command writes feedback for the backend team. If the user wants to IMPLEMENT changes from existing feedback reports, use /feedback:implement-new-api-changes instead.
